cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use XVPN in academic work, please cite it as below.
title: XVPN (幽门)
abstract: >-
  A split-tunnel VPN client for Windows, Linux and Android that takes a
  user-supplied WireGuard, OpenVPN, Hysteria2, Shadowsocks, VMess, VLESS or
  Trojan profile and applies automatic traffic splitting with bundled rule sets,
  dual-resolver DNS with cross-validation, failure attribution derived from core
  logs, and evidence-based automatic routing correction. Built on sing-box, with
  a shared Flutter UI across the three platforms. Ships no nodes, subscriptions
  or accounts — the user brings their own configuration — and collects no data.
  Distributed under the product name 幽门 (romanised: Youmen).
